        "title": "feat(provider): add Sealos Devbox SSH-lease provider",
        "body": "Closes https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/issues/365\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds `sealos-devbox` as a Crabbox Linux SSH-lease provider backed by Sealos DevBox lifecycle resources.\n\nThis includes provider registration and configuration, read-only doctor checks, CRD create/resolve/status/release/cleanup paths, exact scope- and claim-bound ownership checks, controller-owned Secret validation, SSH routing, guarded live-smoke wiring, documentation, and regression coverage.\n\n## Lifecycle safety\n\n- Uses conflict-safe `kubectl create` and reconciles ambiguous results only when the live DevBox exactly matches the requested scope, lease, and slug.\n- Revalidates scope, lease, slug, UID, and Kubernetes `resourceVersion` before destructive operations.\n- Fails closed on inventory and identity errors; stale local claims are discarded only after direct absence proof.\n- Reads key material only from the exact controller-owned DevBox Secret and persists it only in Crabbox's local lease key store.\n- Keeps status and doctor read-only; `kubectl auth can-i` checks permissions without provider mutation.\n- The guarded live smoke now uses delete-on-release and requires empty exact lease/slug inventory after stop, preventing a successful test from leaving a billable paused DevBox.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Exact candidate: `10390b08ad309dfe6446e88dfb790b0f884e4b55`\n- Rebased onto `main` at `5b39acb1d8d0530824f1acc25d73b94bc9a0c773`.\n- `go test -race -timeout 10m ./internal/providers/sealosdevbox -count=1`\n- `go test -race ./internal/cli -count=1`\n- `scripts/test-go-modules.sh`\n- `scripts/check-go-coverage.sh 90.0` (90.8%)\n- `scripts/test-provider-lifecycles.sh`\n- `node --test scripts/*.test.js` (387 passing)\n- Worker format, lint, typecheck, tests, Worker build, dynamic build, and Node build\n- provider matrix generation, command docs, Markdown links, and docs site build\n- `git diff --check`\n- branch AutoReview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings\n- Current upstream contract cross-check: [DevBox v1alpha2 types](https://github.com/labring/sealos/blob/main/controllers/devbox/api/v1alpha2/devbox_types.go), [controller Secret generation](https://github.com/labring/sealos/blob/main/controllers/devbox/internal/controller/devbox_sync_pipeline.go), and [SSHGate public-key forwarding](https://github.com/labring/sealos/blob/main/service/sshgate/gateway/publickey.go).\n\n## Live proof gate\n\nReal doctor/warmup/status/SSH/run/delete/zero-residue proof still requires a Sealos cluster exposing the DevBox CRD, matching RBAC, and SSHGate or NodePort routing. Local `kubectl` is installed, but the available kubeconfig has no context; targeted credential lookup found no Sealos record. No live Sealos resources were created.\n\nKeep this pull request unmerged until the exact candidate completes that authenticated create/use/destroy proof, or the item-specific remote-provider gate is explicitly waived.\n",
